  "dct_description_sm": [
    "Caribou are monitored in the Northwest Territories to inform programs, policies and environmental management and track implementation of the NWT Barren-ground Caribou Management Strategy. Collaring data is used to study seasonal range distribution, measure annual variations in rut and calving locations and determine spring and fall migration routes."
